               <msContents>
                  <msItem xml:id="Tib_blockbooks_a_22_11-item1">
                     <title key="work_949" xml:lang="bo">*སོ་སོ་ཐར་པའི་མདོ་བཞུགས་སོ༎</title>
                     <title key="work_949">so so thar pa'i mdo bzhugs so// Pratimokṣasūtra</title>
                     <title type="margin" xml:lang="bo">སོ་ཐར</title>
                     <title type="margin">so thar</title>
                     <incipit xml:lang="bo">rgya gar skad du / pra ti mok+Sa sUtra / bod skad du / so so thar pa'i mdo / thams cad mkhyen pa la phyag 'tshal lo / / snyan pa'i ba dan 'jig rten gsum du grags / / dam pa'i chos sgra seng ge'i sgra sgrags pa / / thams cad mkhyen pa dkon mchog mdzod brnyes pa / / zhabs la tshangs dbang gtsug gi nor bus gtugs / /</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="bo">gang gi phyir ni mdo 'don dang / / gang phyir gso sbyong byas gyur pa / / tshul khrims de ni bsrung bya ste / / g.yag lnga'i rtse mo ji bzhin no / / so sor thar pa bton pa yi / / bsod nams grub pa gang yod pa / / des ni 'jig rten ma lus par / / thub dbang go 'phang thob par shog / / so so thar pa'i mdo rdzogs so / /</explicit>
                     <colophon xml:lang="bo">kha che bye brag tu smra ba'i slob dpon 'dzi na mi tra dang / zhu chen gyi lo tsa ba ban de klu'i rgyal mtshan gyis bsgyur cing zhus te gtan la phab pa'o / / gcig zhus dag / /</colophon>
